{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_st01",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_st01",
  "title": "“墮天”",
  "storyCode": "MT-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c35ad63a5b8ad6f76bd77bbc74b84bb1fbda9c4d1f024580210b4442db8d22d7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“蕾繆樂，實驗不是結束了嗎？”\n“你還不知道啊？調查員今天來學校告訴我們結果了，還特地帶了水果塔當禮物哦！”\n“法柏爾區中心醫院的那兩組病人都在今天出院了……唔，也就是說，他們的康復情況，和我們這兩個月的祈禱沒有關係，哈哈。”\n“調查員讓我們不要難過，說那本身就只是第六廳的社會實驗而已。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "又一封關於新沃爾西尼的簡報。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "這半年來，它已經和十七座移動城市建立了貿易關係，幾乎沒有一刻停下來，像一隻不知疲倦的凶豕獸……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "當然，它也順便將新的種子帶往了整個敘拉古。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "聽你的語氣，你鼓勵新沃爾西尼和敘拉古的其他城市往來，但不打算為他們推廣《新都市管理法案》的行為背書？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "阿格尼爾，是你從狂歡節回來後，告訴我那些年輕人還需要更多考驗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "……好像是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "特爾尼城傳來消息，魯珀坎有些不尋常的動作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "金色的女皇最近政令不斷，而另一位已經很久不曾露面了……我們的鄰居似乎正急於尋求某些改變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "其實不只萊塔尼亞，這片大地的新苗頭已經夠多了。敘拉古不該再花更多時間在“家族事務”上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "嗯嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "你一副隨時會睡著的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "快到我的午休時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "這塊布料怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "給你訂做一身套裝？這家店的裁縫手藝不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "哈哈，不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "還是習慣穿著這套修士服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "我是神父，西西里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "但是這座城市沒有教堂。你離開拉特蘭已經快七十年了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "六十八年。薩科塔對自我身分的認同與我們對甜點的熱愛同樣持久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "然而你從沒想過回去看看，不過也沒什麼必要就是了，城牆依然潔白，人們依然快樂，樂園不會有變化……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "不然你當年也不會跟著我來到敘拉古。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "不好說……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "最近握守護銃時手總是有點抖，說不定是我在聖城的老房子漏水了之類的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我們都是上個時代的人了，西西里。你知道老傢伙對一些事情的直覺向來準確……\n啊哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "你還是去那邊的沙發上睡一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "等付完這塊布料的訂金，或許我們可以換個地方好好談談。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "Zzz~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的學徒",
      "text": "這是怎麼了？您剛剛是站著睡著了嗎？神父，神父，您沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "嘶——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "沒了？就這麼兩句話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "喂！蒂拉，老大沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "那一疊文件之前就已經給他確認過了，法務大姐們只是稍微做了一些格式上的調整，有需要看那麼久嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "我想克里夫先生在看的恐怕是那封信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "那封從拓荒地寄來的信？我記得是個叫“伍德洛”的傢伙寫的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "可是信上總共不就四個字嘛……“你好，勿念”……沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "達維鎮的事情我多少聽過一點……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "你到底想說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "蒂拉，再過半天，本艦就要進入麥克斯哥倫比亞特區的航線範圍了。我們為了把生意帶進特區已經布局多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "還有很多問題沒有解決，你看看身後的人，所有高層都在等著老大發布命令！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "可是這個時候他的關注點卻在他那個……身上——呃，我詞窮了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "就在本艦出發前，克里夫先生剛去見過一位大人物——傑克遜先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "副、副總統閣下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "你的意思是，我們這次和特區那些公司的合作，老大已經得到哥倫比亞官方層面的保證了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "別那麼激動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "身為黑鋼國際的成員，你完全沒必要懷疑“橋夾”克里夫。你想不到的，他都能想到；你搞不懂的，他都能搞懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "是他聚集了這麼多人，是他將銃械變成了一種可在拉特蘭之外流通的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "是他將我們的生意鋪滿了拓荒地的每一處，甚至延伸到哥倫比亞之外的許多地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "克里夫先生是一位可靠的領袖，一位與眾不同的薩科塔。不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "這我當然同意……可是，蒂拉，老大的臉色也太難看了吧？是那封四字“長信”的殺傷力太大了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "各位——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "怎、怎麼突然停電了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "是哪個傻瓜傭兵誤碰了什麼，還是工程部維修時接錯線了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "好消息好消息！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山火終於撲滅了。\n天啊，半座山頭都燒焦了。嗚——\n咦？伍迪，你怎麼了？受傷了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "咳、咳咳……沒事，不嚴重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "他剛從西側的林場回來，那邊火勢最大，他衝進火場清出了一條隔離帶，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "這麼大的年紀了，也不知道……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "這一片的拓荒工程才剛有了點起色，總不能——好了，潔西卡、海倫娜，真的只是一點小傷……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "嗚，那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "對了，伍迪，你要不要看看這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "咦？好厚一封，是什麼重要的文件嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "從黑鋼寄過來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "伍迪，你不打開嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "不，我不想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "打開吧，萬一裡面是厚厚一疊金券呢？剛好可以填補這場火災燒出的大坑洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "那你開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "我開就我開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "哇，克里夫先生寫了好長一封信啊，都拖到地上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "哎，伍迪，你怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "頭，突然有點痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "是信的原因，還是你身上的傷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "等很久了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "生日快樂，塞西莉亞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "這個蛋糕……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "是、是用搗碎的番薯做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "實在找不到奶油，上面撒的這一層是切碎的野菜乾，我特地挑了顏色比較好看的一些……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "不好意思啊，我已經盡可能做得像了……“奴隸”能接觸到的物資很有限，格琳大姐也悄悄幫了一些忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "我很喜歡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞西莉亞，許個願吧……雖然我已經猜到你會許什麼願望了——放心，我已經在繼續打聽了，我們一定會找到塞西莉亞的爸爸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "但是，我今天的心願是——和艾澤爾哥哥一起吹蠟燭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "媽媽離開後，艾澤爾哥哥一直在幫我。你甚至放棄了自己在公證所的工作，一路陪著我從拉特蘭來到卡茲戴爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "這麼長的時間，這麼長的路，艾澤爾哥哥一直陪在塞西莉亞身邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "其實我知道，在這裡，在爸爸的家鄉，艾澤爾哥哥會面臨很多危險。是艾澤爾哥哥教塞西莉亞不放棄希望的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "所以我想要，艾澤爾哥哥和我一起完成生日最後的儀式！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞西莉亞……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾澤爾的手心傳來暖意，那是塞西莉亞握住了他的手。\n他看著那個用番薯泥做成的生日蛋糕，和面前滿眼寫著期待的小女孩，燦爛地笑了。在搖曳的燭光下，兩人一起低頭唸起了禱詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "拉特蘭的秩序光照我們♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "將生命之路示予我們♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞&艾澤爾",
      "text": "常使我們心歡喜♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉烏尼達東邊的東邊♪\n白色的聖城，拉特蘭♪\n……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的修女",
      "text": "奧羅拉，是你嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "有點吵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的修女",
      "text": "唱詩儀式十分鐘後開始，孩子們已經在練習了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "我是說你，努艾達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "……都解決了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "鬆口氣吧，都埋在後院了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "你要洗一洗身上的血嗎？這裡隨時都可能有孩子過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "怎麼？你害怕我被看到？害怕他們尊敬的努艾達修女竟然會和最令人恐懼的奧羅拉聊怎麼殺人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "別這麼說，如果沒有你，也不會有我們……是你拿起了銃，我才能教會他們唱詩，哄他們睡著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "剛剛過來的是辛嘉斯養的兵，還是真正玻利瓦爾人的游擊隊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "有什麼區別嗎？一群只知道搶人搶錢搶地盤的臭*玻利瓦爾俗語*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "從拉特蘭出來後，誰能想到世界上還有這種糞坑一樣的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "我知道……我知道，在你的家鄉……拉特蘭絕不會有這樣的事情發生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "無論是你的武器、你的裝束、你的生活習慣……你始終是以一個拉特蘭人自居。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "拉特蘭人？哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "說真的，我到現在都不知道你為什麼要信拉特蘭教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "我在玻利瓦爾長大，從小無依無靠，所見的從來只有這些*玻利瓦爾俗語*。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "我想要相信，這片大地除了破屋荒田、交不完的稅和躲不完的戰爭，還有充足的糧食、鮮花和希望……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "你還想要那群小鬼們也相信這些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "只有一個人的信仰，稱不上是信仰。大家都需要彼此攙扶，就像此時此刻的你我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "我們才不算互相攙扶……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "噓……奧羅拉，你像聖光庇護著拉特蘭一樣庇護著這裡，是你讓我得以想像一座沐浴著聖光的樂園——儘管我從未去過那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "嘖，最好別去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "如果你非要相信哪裡有沐浴著聖光的樂園，那肯定不是拉特蘭，去別的地方找吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "畢竟現在我們要放棄這座修道院了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "你該進去了，修女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "孩子們還在等你去領唱最後一個章節。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "奧羅拉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "你當初為什麼離開拉特蘭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "蠢貨，因為我犯罪了……就這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "努艾達推開了禮拜堂的門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉烏尼達東邊的東邊♪\n白色的聖城，拉特蘭♪\n那裡的土地不會爆炸♪\n那裡的田野結出麥穗♪\n那裡有聖主，慈愛像母親♪\n所有禱告祂都聽見，所有願望祂都實現♪\n所有人都由祂來愛♪\n不論沒有腿腳，還是少了手臂♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "……這可能是我們最後一次正式的晚禱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "這幾年，在這個“三不管”的地方，我們盡可能不去招惹是非，不被辛嘉斯的貴族或者號稱游擊隊的暴徒們注意到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "但順著逃稅者和逃刑者的蹤跡，他們已經注意到了這座修道院，盯上了我們的農場和馱獸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "奧羅拉打探清楚了周圍的情況，今天晚上，她會帶我們穿越附近的峽谷離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "我們可能會往北去到平原，也可能會進入更南邊的雨林地帶，旅途很長，幸好今年的作物都採收完了，我們的糧食還足夠……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玻利瓦爾小孩",
      "text": "修女——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "別緊張，雨果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "相信奧羅拉，相信我，相信自己和身邊的人，也相信“拉特蘭”……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "聲音別抖，沒忘記後面的詩句吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉烏尼達東邊的東邊♪\n白色的聖城，拉特蘭♪\n那裡的銃炮放出煙火♪\n那裡的靶子都是蘋果♪\n透過禮拜堂的窗戶，努艾達看見今天的太陽正在沉下去，但隊伍裡薩科塔們的光環還亮著，唱詩班的聲音慢慢響起來。\n這些讚美詩她已經唱誦過無數遍，據說它們最初由聖徒在漫長苦旅中寫就，輾轉流傳，經過玻利瓦爾哲人的改編，至此已逾百年。\n信仰無私，讚美詩有靈，“拉特蘭”會護佑他們，越過接下來的荊棘與長夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "努艾達",
      "text": "這是？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大概是夕陽走得倉促，忘了留下一些光亮，唱詩班中薩科塔的光環與光翼在頃刻間破碎，不再規則，黯淡無光。\n前所未有的驚懼襲捲了努艾達。\n因為羽蛇的傳承，她知曉許多知識與秘辛，但記憶中沒有哪怕一行字、一個符號能夠與她眼前的景象對應起來。\n她喃喃著，一時間甚至忘了停下唱誦，顫抖的聲音在禮拜堂中迴盪著——\n那裡有聖主，慈愛像父親♪\n所有惡人祂都懲罰，所有不公祂都剷除♪\n所有人都由祂來愛♪\n不論生著瘡疤，還是長著石頭♪\n當我們誠心祈禱，祂便給予麵包♪\n當我們向祂奔去，祂便賜予救贖♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧羅拉",
      "text": "*拉特蘭俚語*——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "阿格尼爾，你的光環——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西西里夫人",
      "text": "*敘拉古俚語*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "別吵別吵，搞清楚了，訓練場有個傢伙試銃的時候沒校準參數，把供電管線弄壞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "工程部已經趕過去了，馬上就能恢復供電。奇怪，總感覺有哪裡不對勁……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼高層",
      "text": "黑漆漆的，一點光亮都沒有，當然不對勁——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "對，就是這個！為什麼我們沒看見克里夫先生的光環？按理說這種時候那個東西應該亮得跟電燈一樣——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“橋夾”克里夫",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂拉",
      "text": "克里夫先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "text": "伍迪，我去叫醫生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "伍迪，你，嗚……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥，你的光環，還有光翼，為什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "墮天……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "為什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞西莉亞",
      "text": "是、是塞西莉亞的問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "唔——拉特蘭……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "蕾繆安小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "呼——離這麼遠就看見您了，叫了好幾聲，您都沒有聽見……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "啊，真抱歉，我剛好要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "哎呀，我竟然忘了，今天是您新工作上班第一天！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "我該改口叫您“尊敬的蕾繆安樞機”了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "……雞皮疙瘩都起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "哈哈。從提交申請資料，到成為樞機輔佐官，再到正式晉升為樞機，您只用了兩年的時間吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "我聽說這已經打破了第七廳的歷史記錄……真厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "可惜比我打破輪椅競速射擊賽記錄的速度慢很多呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "開個玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "我什麼時候能像您一樣厲害就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "這裡有整整三條街兩百多位住戶在等著你派送鮮瘤奶呢，不然他們今天的水果塔早餐和消食甜點就都泡湯了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "而在拉特蘭，需要一位樞機處理外交和國安事務的場合能有多少呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "我們兩個誰對拉特蘭更重要可不好說喲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "哈哈，也是。那我也得趕快去工作才行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "老規矩，您的鮮瘤奶我放在門口，還是雙份對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "說起來，蕾繆樂小姐到底是在龍門做物流生意，還是在那家叫羅德島的醫藥公司負責維安事務啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "好久沒看到她了，有點想她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "小樂那孩子，說不定哪天就突然回來了。要是冰箱空著，肯定會鬧脾氣的，哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "也是呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "啊，對了，從這裡去第七廳還得繞一點路，您怎麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "順便去看一位好久沒見的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "這樣啊……那再見，蕾繆安樞機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "送乳員",
      "text": "平常的一天，願律法與你我同在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "再見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一路上撞見了幾個熟面孔，蕾繆安和他們打了招呼。隨後，她在一個街角轉彎，走進另一條再普通不過的街道。\n雲朵在潔淨的街面投下影子，微風攪動空氣中的甜味。漸漸地，周圍變得安靜下來，蕾繆安即將到達今天的目的地。\n毫無疑問，她的生活發生了一些變化。但她的腳步輕快，她欣然地迎接這些變化。\n蕾繆安向來如此。\n或者說，拉特蘭人向來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“平常的一天，願律法與你我同在。”\n蕾繆安這麼低聲唸著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在前路的盡頭，一座建築拔地而起，它異常巨大，幾乎聳入雲端，流線型的結構與周圍低矮的教堂建築格格不入。\n“拔地而起”——這並非一種誇張的形容，那座建築幾乎是憑空出現，卻又彷彿從始至終都矗立在聖城——\n它在歡迎蕾繆安的到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
